* The pit under the cage lift's shaft beside the incubator (openc2e
* Creatures 2 project; owner's screenshot, 2026-11-26: toys lying under the
* floor there). Room 208 (x 5735-5900, y 1175-1300) is the game's own, drawn
* as the shaft's pit below the floor; every doorway out of it is shut, so
* what got in (a spinner, a saxophone, balls) stayed. Each load, objects
* lying in it are set on the incubator room's floor (room 28, y 1200), 260
* px west. Safe to repeat.
enum 2 0 0
  doif posl ge 5730 doif posr le 5905 doif post ge 1165 doif posb le 1305
    setv var0 posl subv var0 260
    setv var1 posb subv var1 post setv var2 1199 subv var2 var1
    mvto var0 var2
  endi endi endi endi
next
